  "description": "We propose <strong>SWEET</strong>, a watermarking method for code generation LLMs. \n              Previous <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2301.10226\">watermarking</a> methods fail to handle code generation scenarios due to syntactic and semantic characteristics of code.\n              SWEET leverages the entropy of token distribution, and shows strong watermarking performance in code generation."
